; POOL EXTENSION (sl-0200): SICKLES — a five-bolt fan whose SINE sway
; ALTERNATES direction shot to shot (prog_b sign flips), so the
; blades cross and re-open as they travel: a weave lattice, not the
; shoal's parallel waves. Pure function of age — bot-projected
; closed-form. Pattern id 39; lead 30 (the fan danger class). Elite
; amber placeholder; identity data-keyed.

